rder-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:6%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:8%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b>57 927</b></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><div name="7848418" id="7848418"><em>Изоҳ: Ушбу рўйхатдаги махсус моддий-техника воситаси ва транспорт воситаларининг тури Экология қўмитаси раисининг буйруғига кўра ўзгартирилиши мумкин.</em></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848279" id="7848279"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7848280" id="7848280">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 18 ноябрдаги ПҚ-343-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7847341">қарорига</a><br />6-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7848294" id="7848294">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасидаги ислоҳотларни янада кучайтириш чора-тадбирлари</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7848295" id="7848295">ДАСТУРИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848296" id="7848296"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7848297" id="7848297"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse;border:none" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" class="a" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Т/р</span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Чора-тадбирлар номи</span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижро муддати</span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Молиялаштириш манбалари</span></b></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:1px solid black;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Масъул ижрочилар</span></b></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">1.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Республикада 18 та дендрология ва 15 та ботаника боғларини ташкил этишни назарда тутувчи норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ишлаб чиқиш учун</span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> — маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Амалга ошириш учун</span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> — утилизация йиғимидан келиб тушган,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Яшил макон» умуммиллий лойиҳасига ҳар йили ажратиладиган, ҳомийлик ва хайрия,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">маҳаллий бюджет маблағлари</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси </span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Вазирлар Кенгаши,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Аҳолини сифатли ва экологик тоза ёқилғи билан таъминлаган ҳолда АИ-80 бензинини автомобилларга ёқилғи қуйиш шохобчаларида сотишни олдини олиш бўйича қатъий назорат ўрнатиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил 1 декабрдан бошлаб,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">доимий равишда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Электр энергияси, нефть маҳсулотлари ва газдан фойдаланишни назорат қилиш инспекцияси, Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">3.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент шаҳрида экологик барқарорликни таъминлаш, аҳолининг ҳаёт сифатини ошириш ҳамда яшил ҳудудлар қамровини кенгайтириш мақсадида «Яшил Тошкент» лойиҳасини амалга ошириш бўйича республика ишчи гуруҳи таркибини тасдиқлаш ва унинг вазифаларини белгилаш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ишчи гуруҳ фаолиятини Тошкент шаҳрида кўкаламзорлаштириш, ҳимоявий ва рекреация аҳамиятига эга яшил ҳудудлар майдонини кўпайтириш, замонавий ландшафт ва шаҳар экотизимини ривожлантириш, суғориш ва парваришлаш инфратузилмасини янгилаш, энергия тежамкор ва рақамли мониторинг ечимларини жорий этиш бўйича чора-тадбирларни мувофиқлаштиришга йўналтириш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ишчи гуруҳ таркибига Экология қўмитаси, Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимлиги, Қурилиш ва уй-жой коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги, Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги, Олий таълим, фан ва инновациялар вазирлиги ҳамда бошқа тегишли вазирлик ва идоралар вакилларини киритиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил ноябрь</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маҳаллий бюджет маблағлари</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қишлоқ хўжалиги вазирлиги</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Соғлиқни сақлаш вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">манфаатдор вазирлик ва идоралар</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">4.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Халқаро стандартлар талабларига жавоб берадиган қурилиш учун ажратилган объектларда қурилиш бошланишидан олдин қурувчи ташкилотлар томонидан фон мониторинг станциялари ва онлайн камералар ўрнатилиши ва бошқа экологик талабларни амалга оширишни назарда тутувчи «Қурилишда экологик фаолият стандарти талаблари»ни ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил март</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қурилиш ва уй-жой</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">5.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент шаҳар ўрмон хўжалигини ташкил этиш бўйича Ҳукумат қарори лойиҳасини ишлаб чиқиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент шаҳар ўрмон хўжалигининг вазифа ва асосий фаолият йўналишларини белгилаш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">ўрмон хўжалигининг штат бирликлари ва моддий-техника базасини ташкил қилишни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ишлаб чиқиш учун</span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> — маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ташкил қилиш учун</span></i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> — маҳаллий бюджет маблағлари</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон агентлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">6.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Халқаро тажрибани ўрганган ҳолда шамол йўналишлари (роза ветров) ва тезлигини ҳисобга олган ҳолда қурилишни амалга оширишни назарда тутувчи стандарт ишлаб чиқиш. Бунда шамол йўналишини инобатга олган ҳолда:</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">бино ва иншоотларга қўйиладиган талабларни белгилаш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">бино ва иншоотларнинг жойлашувини, шамол ўтишини ҳисобга олиш;</span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">қурилиш ишларини бошлашдан олдин қурилиш, экология ва кадастр органларининг хулосаларини олиш тартибини белгилаш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил апрель</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қурилиш ва уй-жой</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">коммунал хўжалиги вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кадастр агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўзбекистон техник жиҳатдан тартибга солиш агентлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">7.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Гидрометеорология хизмати агентлиги томонидан Тошкент шаҳрида шамол йўналишини доимий ўрганиб бориш ва шамол йўналиши тўғрисидаги маълумотларни оммавий ахборот воситалари орқали кенг жамоатчиликка етказиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил ноябрдан бошлаб, доимий равишда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ижрочилар маблағлари</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">8.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент шаҳар ва Тошкент вилоятида мавжуд иссиқхона хўжаликларини табиий газ билан барқарор таъминлаш бўйича зарур ташкилий-техник чора-тадбирлар тўғрисида таклифлар ишлаб чиқиш. Бунда:</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">мавжуд иссиқхона хўжаликларининг табиий газга бўлган эҳтиёжи, мавжуд қувватлар ва тармоқларга уланиш имкониятларини таҳлил қилиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">иссиқхона хўжаликлари жойлашган ҳудудлардаги газ тақсимоти тармоқларининг техник ҳолати ва мавжуд қувватини хатловдан ўтказиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">энергия тежамкор иситиш технологияларини жорий этиш, шу жумладан, табиий газдан самарали фойдаланиш <a name="_Hlk211163892">ва альтернатив манбалар (биогаз, қуёш энергияси) билан </a>уйғунлаштириш имкониятларини ўрганиш;</span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">табиий газ билан узлуксиз таъминлаш бўйича мавсумий графиклар, лимит ва тариф механизмларини такомиллаштириш, иссиқхона хўжаликлари фаолиятида узилишларнинг олдини олиш чораларини кўриш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ҳисоб-китобларга кўра</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Энергетика вазирлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент вилояти ҳокимлиги<i>,</i></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги</span><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">,</span></i></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:7.35pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">9.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Мазут ва шунга ўхшаш юқори ифлослантирувчи ёқилғи турларидан фойдаланган ҳолда атмосферага зарарли моддалар чиқарилиши ҳолатларининг олдини олиш мақсадида жавобгарлик чораларини кучайтириш бўйича қонунчилик ҳужжатларига ўзгартириш киритиш юзасидан таклифлар ишлаб чиқиш.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил декабрь</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Адлия вазирлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Энергетика вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">10.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="color:#0d0d0d">Тошкент</span></span><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt"> шаҳри ҳудудида юк ташиш автотранспорт воситалари ҳаракатини тиғиз вақтларда чеклаш амалиётини йўлга қўйиш. </span></span></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бунда Ички ишлар вазирлиги ушбу тартиб жорий қилинадиган кўчаларни алоҳида белгилаб беради.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2025 йил декабрдан бошлаб, доимий равишда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимлиги,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ички ишлар вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">11.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Дарахт ва буталарни санитария мақсадида кесиш тартибини такомиллаштириш. Бунда дарахт ва буталарни санитария мақсадида кесиш учун рухсатномани коллегиал овоз бериш тартибида кўриб чиқиб, кесишга рухсат беришни назарда тутиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил февраль</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Фанлар академияси,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Адлия вазирлиги</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">12.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва иқлим ўзгариши вазирлиги бошқарув ходимлари фаолиятига баҳо бериб, уларнинг аттестациядан ўтказилишини таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бир ой муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Маблағ талаб этилмайди</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">13.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитасининг туман (шаҳар) бўлинмаларини белгиланган тартибда бино ва иншоотлар билан таъминлаш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Бир ой муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ажратилган маблағлар доирасида</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:3%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">14.</span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:44%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p style="text-indent:7.6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:1.6pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ҳудудларни ободонлаштириш хизматлари ва «Яшил ҳудуд» давлат муассасаси фаолиятини такомиллаштириш бўйича норматив-ҳуқуқий ҳужжат лойиҳасини Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президенти Администрациясига киритиш.</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:11%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Икки ой муддатда</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">-</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:21%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Экология қўмитаси,</span></span></span></span></p><p align="center" style="text-align:center;text-indent:0cm"><span style="font-size:14pt"><span style="tab-stops:.05pt"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Иқтисодиёт ва молия вазирлиги, Қорақалпоғистон Республикаси Вазирлар Кенгаши, вилоятлар ва Тошкент шаҳар ҳокимликлари</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848281" id="7848281"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7848282" id="7848282">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 18 ноябрдаги ПҚ-343-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7847341">қарорига</a><br />7-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7848283" id="7848283">Ягона экологик онлайн платформага қўйиладиган</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7848284" id="7848284">АСОСИЙ ТАЛАБЛАР</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848285" id="7848285"></div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="7848286" id="7848286">1. Экология соҳасидаги ҳуқуқбузарлик ҳолатларини масофавий аниқлаш имкониятларини яратиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="7848287" id="7848287">2. Масофавий назорат механизмларини жорий қилиш орқали бошқарув жараёнида инсон омилини қисқартириш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="7848288" id="7848288">3. Экологик маълумотлар асосида атроф-муҳитга салбий таъсир қилувчи табиий ва антропоген ҳолатларни таҳлил қилиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="7848289" id="7848289">4. Атмосфера ҳавоси ҳолати билан боғлиқ бўлган хавфли ҳодисалар тўғрисида аҳолини эрта огоҳлантириш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="7848290" id="7848290">5. Экология соҳасидаги сертификат, экспертиза ва рухсат этиш хусусиятига эга бўлган ҳужжатларни тақдим қилиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="7848291" id="7848291">6. Тўпланган маълумотлар асосида ҳуқуқбузарларга онлайн равишда таъсир чораларини белгилаш имкониятини яратиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="7848292" id="7848292">7. Катта ҳажмдаги маълумотлар билан ишлашнинг самарали усулларини ва онлайн давлат экологик назорати технологияларини жорий қилиш.</div></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><div name="7848293" id="7848293">8. Соҳага сунъий интеллект, «Big data» технологияларини жорий этиш.</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848298" id="7848298"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7848301" id="7848301">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 18 ноябрдаги ПҚ-343-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7847341">қарорига</a><br />8-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7848302" id="7848302">2026 йилда Ўзбекистон Республикасининг республика бюджетидан Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармасига мақсадли ажратиладиган</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7848303" id="7848303">МАБЛАҒЛАР</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848304" id="7848304"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7848305" id="7848305"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:82%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-left:none"><p align="right" style="text-align:right"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">(млн сўм)</span></i></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:82%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Кўрсаткичлар</span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">2026 йил режа</span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:82%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Жами</span></b></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><b><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">548 000</span></b></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:82%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ҳайвонот ва ўсимлик дунёси ва муҳофаза этиладиган табиий ҳудудлар давлат кадастрларини юритиш харажатлари учун</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">8 000</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:82%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Чўлланиш ва қум кўчишининг олдини олиш мақсадида ҳимоя ўрмонларини (иҳота) яратиш</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">73 715</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:82%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўрмон хўжалигида махсус техникаларни харид қилиш </span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">66 285</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:82%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">«Яшил макон» умуммиллий лойиҳаси доирасидаги харажатлар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">250 000</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:82%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:1px solid black"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Санитар тозалаш ишларини ташкил этиш билан боғлиқ харажатлар</span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom:1px solid black;width:17%;padding:0cm 4px 0cm 4px;border-top:none;border-right:1px solid black;border-left:none"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">150 000</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848307" id="7848307"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7848308" id="7848308">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 18 ноябрдаги ПҚ-343-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7847341">қарорига</a><br />9-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7848309" id="7848309">Атроф табиий муҳитнинг ифлослантирилганлиги ва чиқиндиларнинг жойлаштирилганлиги учун компенсация тўловлари, табиатни муҳофаза қилиш тўғрисидаги қонунчилик бузилишида айбдор бўлган жисмоний ва юридик шахслардан маъмурий ва суд тартибида ундириладиган жарималар, молиявий санкциялар ва пул маблағларидан ажратмалар</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7848310" id="7848310">МИҚДОРИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848322" id="7848322"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7848331" id="7848331"><table class="Table" style="width: 100.0%;border-collapse: collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" rowspan="3" style="width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><strong>Т/р</strong></span></span></p></td><td nowrap="nowrap" rowspan="3" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: 1px solid black;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><strong>Кўрсаткичлар</strong></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="3" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: 1px solid black;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><strong>2025 йилда белгиланган миқдорлар</strong></span></span></p></td><td colspan="2" nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 29.3974%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: 1px solid black;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><strong>2026 йилдан бошлаб</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 18px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><strong>Экология жамғармасига</strong></span></span></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;height: 18px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif"><strong>Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармасига</strong></span></span></p></td></tr><tr></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">1.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Атроф табиий муҳит ифлослантирилганлиги ва чиқиндилар жойлаштирилганлиги учун компенсация тўловлари</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">60</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">45</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">15</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">2.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Табиатни муҳофаза қилиш тўғрисидаги қонунчилик бузилишида айбдор бўлган жисмоний ва юридик шахслардан маъмурий ва суд тартибида ундириладиган жарималар ва пул маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">87</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">37</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">3.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ҳайвонот ва ўсимлик дунёси объектларидан фойдаланиш билан боғлиқ қонун бузилишлари учун ундириладиган жарималар ва пул маблағлари</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">87</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">37</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">4.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Мусодара қилинган ов ва балиқ овлаш қуроллари, ноқонуний ов қилиш ва балиқ овлаш натижасида олиб қўйилган маҳсулотлар ҳамда ўсимлик дунёси объектларидан ноқонуний фойдаланишдан олинган маҳсулотлар учун ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">87</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">37</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">5.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Давлат ўрмон фондига кирмайдиган дарахт ва буталарни кесганлик учун тўловлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">78,25</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">28,25</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">6.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ёввойи ҳайвонларни овлаш, шунингдек, Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қизил китобига киритилган камёб ва йўқолиб кетиш хавфи остидаги ёввойи ҳайвонларни табиий муҳитдан олиш учун рухсатнома тўловлари</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">60</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">10</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">7.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ўсимлик дунёси объектларидан, жумладан, Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қизил китобига киритилган камёб ва йўқолиб кетиш хавфи остидаги ўсимлик объектларидан махсус фойдаланиш учун рухсатнома тўловлари</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">78,25</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">28,25</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">8.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Яланғоч қизилмияни қайта ишлаш маҳсулотини (суюқ ва кукунсимон экстрактларини), шунингдек, яланғоч қизилмияни маҳсулот сифатида четга олиб чиқишга берилган рухсатнома учун ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">9.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қизил китобга киритилган ёввойи ҳайвонлар ва ёввойи ўсимликларни ҳамда ёввойи ҳайвонлар ва ёввойи ўсимликларнинг бошқа турларини олиб чиқиш учун ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">10.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ёввойи ҳайвонларни тутишга, ёввойи ўсимликларни (ғамлаш) тўплашга, Ўзбекистон Республикаси Қизил китобига киритилган ёввойи ҳайвонларни ҳамда ёввойи ўсимликларни тўплашга рухсатномалар учун аризаларни кўриб чиқиш учун ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">78,25</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">28,25</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">11.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ички ишлар органлари профилактика (бош, катта, кичик) инспекторлари томонидан экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасидаги ҳуқуқбузарликлар учун маъмурий жавобгарликка тортиш чоралари кўрилиши натижасида жарима сифатида ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">90</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">40</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">12.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ички ишлар органлари патруль-пост хизмати ходимлари томонидан экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасидаги ҳуқуқбузарликлар учун маъмурий жавобгарликка тортиш чоралари кўрилиши натижасида жарима сифатида ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">90</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">40</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">13.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Миллий гвардия ҳарбий хизматчилари (ходимлари) томонидан экология ва атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасидаги ҳуқуқбузарликлар учун маъмурий жавобгарликка тортиш чоралари кўрилиши натижасида жарима сифатида ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">30</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">30</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">14.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ёввойи ҳайвонлар ва ёввойи ўсимликларнинг бошқа турларини олиб чиқиш учун ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">15.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ўрмон хўжалигини ривожлантириш жамғармаси маблағларини шакллантириш манбаларида назарда тутилган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">16.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Овчилик хўжалигини юритиш ҳуқуқи юридик ёки жисмоний шахслар томонидан ов қилиш жойларини бериш тўғрисидаги шартномада назарда тутилган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">17.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Табиатни муҳофаза қилиш соҳасидаги қонунчиликни бузганлик ва атроф-муҳит объектларига етказилган зарарни қоплаш учун чет эл фуқаролари, шунингдек, бошқа давлатларнинг юридик шахсларидан маъмурий ва суд тартибида ундириладиган жарималар ва маблағлар (ҳайвонот ва ўсимлик дунёси объектларидан фойдаланиш билан боғлиқ қонунчилик бузилгани учун ундириладиган жарималар ва маблағлар бундан мустасно)</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">74</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">24</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">18.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Давлат ўрмон фонди участкаларини ижарага беришдан тушадиган тушумлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">19.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Давлат қўриқхоналари буфер зоналари, миллий табиат боғлари, питомниклар ер участкаларини ва давлат мулки объектларини ижарага беришдан тушадиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">40</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">40</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">20.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Давлат қўриқхоналари буфер зоналари, миллий табиат боғлари, питомниклар, ўрмон ва ўрмон-ов хўжаликлари ҳудудига кириш учун тўловлардан тушадиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">30</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">30</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">21.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Норуда материалларни ноқонуний қазиб олиш оқибатида табиий объектларга етказилган зарарни қоплашдан тушадиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">87</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">37</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">22.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Мораторий даврида дарё ўзанлари, соҳилбўйи минтақалари ва сувни муҳофаза қилиш зоналаридан қум-шағал материалларини ноқонуний қазиб олиш натижасида табиатга етказилган зарар учун ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">23.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Ифлослантирувчи моддалар авария туфайли кўплаб чиқариб ташланиши (оқова оқизиш, чиқиндиларни жойлаштириш) туфайли атроф-муҳитга етказилган зарар учун табиатдан фойдаланувчилардан ундириладиган маблағлар ва жарималар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">74</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">50</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">24</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">24.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Табиий ресурслардан ҳамда улардан олинадиган хомашёдан меъёридан ортиқча ва нокомплекс фойдаланганлик (нобуд қилганлик) учун табиатдан фойдаланувчилар тўловлари</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">40</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">40</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">25.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Хўжалик фаолияти ва бошқа фаолият натижасида атроф табиий муҳит объектларига етказилган зарарни қоплаш учун табиатдан фойдаланувчилардан ундириладиган маблағлар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">40</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">40</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td></tr><tr><td nowrap="nowrap" style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 3.09446%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">26.</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 55.3746%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: none;border-left: none"><p style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">Экология, атроф-муҳитни муҳофаза қилиш ва табиатдан фойдаланиш соҳасидаги қонунчиликни бузганлик учун юридик шахсларга нисбатан молиявий санкциялар</span></span></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 12.1336%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: 1px solid black"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 13.1107%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"></p></td><td style="border-bottom: 1px solid black;width: 16.2866%;padding: 0cm 4px;border-top: none;border-right: 1px solid black;border-left: none"><p align="center" style="text-align: center"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif">100</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848333" id="7848333"></div></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><div name="7848336" id="7848336">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Президентининг 2025 йил 18 ноябрдаги ПҚ-343-сон <a href="https://lex.uz/docs/7847341">қарорига</a><br />10-ИЛОВА</div></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><div name="7848339" id="7848339">Умуммиллий экологик муаммоларни бартараф этиш давлат мақсадли жамғармаси бошқарув кенгашининг</div></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><div name="7848342" id="7848342">ТАРКИБИ</div></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><div name="7848348" id="7848348"></div></div><div class="TABLE_STD2"><div name="7848349" id="7848349"><table class="Table" style="width:100.0%;border-collapse:collapse" width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="width:3%;padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">1.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="width: 153px;padding: 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><i><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Лавозимига кўра</span></i></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="width: 35px;padding: 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-