oman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">3.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="width: 153px;padding: 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">А. Хамзаев</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="width: 35px;padding: 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">—</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="width: 1579px;padding: 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">Ўзбекистон Республикаси Олий Мажлиси Қонунчилик палатаси фракция раҳбари, Ўзбекистон Экологик партияси Марказий Кенгаши Ижроия қўмитаси раиси</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="width:3%;padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">4.</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="width: 153px;padding: 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">А. Захидов</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td style="width: 35px;padding: 0cm 7px" valign="top"><p align="center" style="text-align:center"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span><span style="line-height:normal"><span style="font-family:"Times New Roman",serif"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size:12.0pt">—</span></span></span></s